    <!-- Parental PIN -->
    <string name="pin_setting">Parental PIN</string>
    <string name="pin_setting_sub">Asks for a PIN before Settings open, blocking is turned off, private browsing starts or History is deleted</string>
    <string name="pin_value_on">On</string>
    <string name="pin_intro">Sofa will ask for a 4-digit PIN before anyone:\n\n• opens Settings\n• turns ad blocking off, for every site or for one\n• lets a site through Site filters\n• turns private browsing on\n• deletes History\n\nIt can\'t stop anyone from using another app, changing the TV\'s settings or removing Sofa.\n\nForgot the PIN? The only way back is clearing Sofa\'s data in the TV\'s settings, which also removes your bookmarks, lists and settings.</string>
