    <string name="no_engine_title">Sofa can\'t show web pages on this TV</string>
    <string name="no_engine_text">Sofa shows pages with the web engine that comes with your TV, Android System WebView, and this TV has none that works: it may be missing or turned off. Look for \"Android System WebView\" in your TV\'s app store, or in Settings → Apps with system apps shown, and install it or turn it on. Then open Sofa again.</string>
